;------------------------------------------------------------------------------
; ROBININD.MAC -- HUD icons, message icons, ornaments and screen messages.
;
; Ported verbatim from the ZX original, $B434-$B8FA.  Labels keep the original
; addresses: L<hex address>.
;
; These are not bitmaps: each entry is a message for the text printer at $D6AB
; -- a run of font glyph codes (see ROBINFNT.MAC) interleaved with position and
; attribute bytes, terminated by 000.  The artwork itself lives in the font, in
; the custom glyph codes above 140.  Codes 040-137 are literal ASCII, so text
; runs are kept as .ASCII and the position/attribute runs as .BYTE.
;
; Most entries are reached as message indices through the table at $D7CE; a few
; are printed by direct address instead.
;
; Some entries begin with a packed position word that $D619 dereferences rather
; than glyph data -- LB51F, LB52D and LB663 all do, so their real glyphs start
; 2 bytes later.
;------------------------------------------------------------------------------

; Odin logo (custom font glyphs), message index $0F in $D7CE
